---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="VMS · 数字花园 (基座就绪)">
	<main class="h-full flex items-center justify-center p-4">
		<div class="max-w-md w-full p-8 bg-paperCard rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-stone-200 text-center">
			<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-limeBrand text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mx-auto mb-4 shadow-sm">V</div>
			<h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">VMS · 数字花园</h1>
			<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-4">纸墨设计系统 + 100vh 零长视窗基座已就绪</p>
			
			<div class="flex flex-col gap-2 items-center">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-limeLight text-limeDark text-xs font-mono font-medium border border-limeBrand/25">
					<span>● 100vh 零长视窗基座 (BaseLayout) 挂载正常</span>
				</div>
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-paperIvory text-stone-700 text-[11px] font-mono border border-stone-200">
					<span>🎨 纸墨主题变量 (青柠/牙白/竹青/墨黑) 生效</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
